## Predictions (written before the run)
- the pool gates agitation too: agitated arrivals in the closed arm are confined to the three species left open; the control shows a wider agitated mix drawn from the whole embark
- agitation bypasses the pool: closed species arrive agitated anyway — the closed arm's agitated mix matches the control's, and the roster promises nothing on a savage map
- agitation is not reachable from the counters: no unit is ever agitated in either arm despite a computed chance of 100%, which means the roll reads something else and v6.1 needs a different lever

